    "body": "Problem: Visual-block `*` and `#` search for virtual padding past line ends when `virtualedit` is enabled, so the search fails.\r\r\n\r\r\nSolution: use `getregionpos()` to remove only that padding. Preserve real trailing whitespace, multibyte text, block width across short lines, and option values.\r\r\n\r\r\nFixes #42514.\r\r\n\r\r\nValidation: regression fails before the change; all 16 tests in `test/functional/editor/defaults_spec.lua` pass using the repository harness and local Lua runtime with the official nightly binary (`v0.13.0-dev-1943+gd714648b8e`, `--luamod-dev`). StyLua and `git diff --check` pass. No full source build or full test suite was run.\r\r\n\r\r\nFollow-up validation on Windows: all 3 visual-search tests pass with the official nightly binary (v0.13.0-dev-1946+g659164699f). The full runtime EmmyLua check and changed-file StyLua checks pass. The commit uses the required bare AI-assisted disclosure.\r\n\r\nAI-assisted. The contributor's personal review required by CONTRIBUTING.md remains outstanding.\r\r\n\r\r\n",
